<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <%- include('partials/seo', { defaultTitle: 'Tài Liệu API - Douyin Downloader' }) %>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; background: #0e1117; color: #c9d1d9; }
    nav { padding: 1rem 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    nav .logo { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
    nav .logo span { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fe2c55, #25f4ee); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
    nav .nav-links a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-left: 1.2rem; transition: color 0.2s; }
    nav .nav-links a:hover { color: #fff; }
    .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .subtitle { color: #8b949e; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d; }
    p { font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
    .endpoint { background: #161b22; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; overflow: hidden; }
    .endpoint-header { padding: 0.8rem 1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d; }
    .method { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .method.post { background: rgba(56,139,253,0.15); color: #58a6ff; }
    .method.get { background: rgba(63,185,80,0.15); color: #3fb950; }
    .endpoint-path { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #e6edf3; }
    .endpoint-desc { padding: 0.6rem 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #8b949e; }
    .code-block { position: relative; background: #0d1117; border-top: 1px solid #21262d; padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; }
    .code-block pre { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #c9d1d9; white-space: pre; margin: 0; }
    .code-block .copy-btn { position: absolute; top: 0.6rem; right: 0.6rem; background: #21262d; border: 1px solid #30363d; color: #8b949e; font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .code-block .copy-btn:hover { color: #fff; }
    .response-label { padding: 0.5rem 1rem 0; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; color: #3fb950; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; background: #0d1117; border-top: 1px solid #21262d; }
    .response-block { background: #0d1117; padding: 0.6rem 1rem 1rem; overflow-x: auto; }
    .response-block pre { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.78rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #7ee787; margin: 0; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: 0.5rem; }
    .badge.auth { background: rgba(254,44,85,0.15); color: #fe2c55; }
    .badge.free { background: rgba(63,185,80,0.15); color: #3fb950; }
    .badge.credits { background: rgba(255,213,79,0.15); color: #ffd54f; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
    .note { background: rgba(56,139,253,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(56,139,253,0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.8rem 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #58a6ff; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .note code { background: rgba(56,139,253,0.15); padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
    .flow-note { background: rgba(254,44,85,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(254,44,85,0.2); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.8rem 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #ff6b8a; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    th, td { text-align: left; padding: 0.8rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    th { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }
    td { color: #8b949e; }
    
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .container { padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem; }
      h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
      .endpoint-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; padding: 1rem; }
      .endpoint-path { word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all; }
      .code-block pre, .response-block pre { font-size: 0.75rem; white-space: pre; overflow-x: auto; }
      .table-wrapper { width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header', {navTheme: 'dark'}) %>

  <div class="container">
    <h1>Tài Liệu Cung Cấp API</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Sử dụng API Token của bạn để tự động hóa việc lưu video Douyin vào ứng dụng từ xa.</p>

    <div class="note">
      🔑 <strong>Xác thực:</strong> Truyền API Token của bạn nằm trong Header gửi đi là <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;your_token&gt;</code>.<br>
      Lấy Token của bạn tại trang <a href="/dashboard" style="color:#58a6ff">Bảng Điều Khiển Quản Lý</a>.
    </div>

    <div class="flow-note">
      🔄 <strong>Luồng xếp hàng (Queue):</strong> Tất cả endpoint đều trả về 1 mã <code>jobId</code>. Bạn dùng mã này và liên tục poll gọi hàm <code>GET /api/job/:jobId</code> cho tới khi <code>state</code> là <code>completed</code> (hoàn tất) hoặc <code>failed</code> (lỗi).
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>💰 Bảng Phí Credits</h2>
      <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table>
        <thead>
          <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid #30363d; text-align:left;">
            <th style="padding:0.6rem 1rem; color:#fff;">Endpoint</th>
            <th style="padding:0.6rem 1rem; color:#ffd54f; text-align:center;">Credits / request</th>
            <th style="padding:0.6rem 1rem; color:#8b949e;">Mô tả</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #21262d;">
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem;"><code>POST /api/video/parse</code></td>
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem; text-align:center; color:#ffd54f; font-weight:600;">10</td>
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem; color:#8b949e;">Parse thông tin video</td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #21262d;">
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem;"><code>POST /api/video/download</code></td>
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem; text-align:center; color:#ffd54f; font-weight:600;">10</td>
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem; color:#8b949e;">Lấy link tải video</td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #21262d;">
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem;"><code>POST /api/channel/videos</code></td>
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem; text-align:center; color:#ffd54f; font-weight:600;">20</td>
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem; color:#8b949e;">Lấy danh sách video kênh</td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #21262d;">
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem;"><code>POST /api/channel/download</code></td>
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem; text-align:center; color:#ffd54f; font-weight:600;">20</td>
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem; color:#8b949e;">Batch download video kênh</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem;"><code>POST /api/free/parse</code></td>
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem; text-align:center; color:#3fb950; font-weight:600;">Miễn phí</td>
            <td style="padding:0.5rem 1rem; color:#8b949e;">Parse video (không cần auth)</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── Video Parse ─────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="section">
      <h2>Video Endpoints</h2>

      <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
          <span class="method post">POST</span>
          <span class="endpoint-path">/api/video/parse</span>
          <span class="badge auth">🔒 Auth</span>
          <span class="badge credits">💰 10 credits</span>
        </div>
        <div class="endpoint-desc">Parse a Douyin video URL. Returns a jobId to poll for video info.</div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCode(this)">Copy</button>
<pre>curl -X POST https://thq-solution-tools.io.vn/api/video/parse \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"url": "https://v.douyin.com/xxxxx"}'</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="response-label">✅ Response</div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "jobId": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "message": "Job queued. Poll GET /api/job/:jobId for result."
  }
}</pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
          <span class="method post">POST</span>
          <span class="endpoint-path">/api/video/download</span>
          <span class="badge auth">🔒 Auth</span>
          <span class="badge credits">💰 10 credits</span>
        </div>
        <div class="endpoint-desc">Queue a video download job. Poll the jobId to get the download URL.</div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCode(this)">Copy</button>
<pre>curl -X POST https://thq-solution-tools.io.vn/api/video/download \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"url": "https://v.douyin.com/xxxxx"}'</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="response-label">✅ Response</div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "jobId": "f7e6d5c4-b3a2-1098-7654-321fedcba098",
    "message": "Job queued. Poll GET /api/job/:jobId for download URL."
  }
}</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── Channel ─────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="section">
      <h2>Channel Endpoints</h2>

      <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
          <span class="method post">POST</span>
          <span class="endpoint-path">/api/channel/videos</span>
          <span class="badge auth">🔒 Auth</span>
          <span class="badge credits">💰 20 credits</span>
        </div>
        <div class="endpoint-desc">Get a list of videos from a Douyin user/channel profile. Sorted by newest first. Supports date filtering with <code>since</code> parameter.</div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCode(this)">Copy</button>
<pre>curl -X POST https://thq-solution-tools.io.vn/api/channel/videos \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"url": "https://www.douyin.com/user/xxxxx", "count": 20, "since": "today"}'</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="endpoint-desc" style="border-top:1px solid #21262d; padding-top:0.6rem;">
          📌 <strong>Tham số <code>since</code></strong> (tùy chọn): Chỉ lấy video đăng từ ngày này trở đi.<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;• <code>"today"</code> — Chỉ video hôm nay<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;• <code>"yesterday"</code> — Từ hôm qua<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;• <code>"2026-04-01"</code> — Từ ngày cụ thể<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;• Không truyền — Lấy tất cả
        </div>
        <div class="response-label">✅ Response</div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "jobId": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901",
    "message": "Job queued. Poll GET /api/job/:jobId for result."
  }
}</pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
          <span class="method post">POST</span>
          <span class="endpoint-path">/api/channel/download</span>
          <span class="badge auth">🔒 Auth</span>
          <span class="badge credits">💰 20 credits</span>
        </div>
        <div class="endpoint-desc">Start a batch download of videos from a channel. Returns a task ID for tracking.</div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCode(this)">Copy</button>
<pre>curl -X POST https://thq-solution-tools.io.vn/api/channel/download \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"url": "https://www.douyin.com/user/xxxxx", "count": 10}'</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="response-label">✅ Response</div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "taskId": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-234567890123",
    "status": "started",
    "total": 10
  }
}</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── Job Polling ─────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="section">
      <h2>Job Polling</h2>

      <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
          <span class="method get">GET</span>
          <span class="endpoint-path">/api/job/:jobId</span>
          <span class="badge free">🔓 No auth</span>
        </div>
        <div class="endpoint-desc">Poll a queued job for its status and result. Keep polling until <code>state</code> is <code>completed</code> or <code>failed</code>.</div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCode(this)">Copy</button>
<pre>curl https://thq-solution-tools.io.vn/api/job/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="response-label">⏳ Waiting / Active</div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "state": "active",
    "data": { "type": "video.parse", "url": "https://v.douyin.com/xxxxx" }
  }
}</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="response-label">✅ Completed</div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "state": "completed",
    "result": {
      "video_id": "7328xxxxx",
      "title": "Video title here",
      "author": { "nickname": "username", "uid": "...", "sec_uid": "..." },
      "cover_url": "https://p3-sign.douyinpic.com/...",
      "download_url": "https://www.douyin.com/aweme/...",
      "duration": 15,
      "create_time": "2026-04-02T10:00:00.000Z",
      "statistics": { "likes": 1000, "comments": 50, "shares": 10 }
    }
  }
}</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="response-label">❌ Failed</div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "state": "failed",
    "error": "Could not extract video ID from URL"
  }
}</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── Free ────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="section">
      <h2>Free Endpoint</h2>

      <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
          <span class="method post">POST</span>
          <span class="endpoint-path">/api/free/parse</span>
          <span class="badge free">🔓 No auth</span>
        </div>
        <div class="endpoint-desc">Parse a Douyin video URL (free, no token or credits needed). Returns a jobId to poll.</div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCode(this)">Copy</button>
<pre>curl -X POST https://thq-solution-tools.io.vn/api/free/parse \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"url": "https://v.douyin.com/xxxxx"}'</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="response-label">✅ Response</div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "jobId": "d4e5f6a7-b8c9-0123-def0-456789abcdef"
  }
}</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── Error Responses ─────────────────────── -->
    <div class="section">
      <h2>Error Responses</h2>

      <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
          <span class="method post" style="background:rgba(254,44,85,0.15); color:#fe2c55;">401</span>
          <span class="endpoint-path">Unauthorized</span>
        </div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": false,
  "error": "Unauthorized: Missing or invalid token format. Use \"Bearer &lt;token&gt;\""
}</pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
          <span class="method post" style="background:rgba(254,44,85,0.15); color:#fe2c55;">402</span>
          <span class="endpoint-path">Insufficient Credits</span>
        </div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": false,
  "error": "Payment Required: Insufficient credits. You need 10 credits, but have 0."
}</pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
          <span class="method post" style="background:rgba(254,44,85,0.15); color:#fe2c55;">403</span>
          <span class="endpoint-path">Account Banned</span>
        </div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": false,
  "error": "Forbidden: Your account has been banned. Contact admin."
}</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── Health ──────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="section">
      <h2>Health Check</h2>
      <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
          <span class="method get">GET</span>
          <span class="endpoint-path">/api/health</span>
          <span class="badge free">🔓 No auth</span>
        </div>
        <div class="endpoint-desc">Check if the API server is running.</div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCode(this)">Copy</button>
<pre>curl https://thq-solution-tools.io.vn/api/health</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="response-label">✅ Response</div>
        <div class="response-block">
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "status": "ok",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-30T09:00:00.000Z"
}</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function copyCode(btn) {
      const pre = btn.parentElement.querySelector('pre');
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(pre.textContent).then(() => {
        btn.textContent = 'Copied!';
        setTimeout(() => btn.textContent = 'Copy', 1500);
      });
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
